      "notes": "Builds the default ABI 0.1 and feature-isolated ABI 0.2 dynamic libraries, verifies their exact 31/37-symbol public export sets (including ABI 0.2/editor absence from the default binary), and compares ABI 0.1 mesh/update observations for a valid unmasked tracked fixture before running the ABI 0.2 implementation smoke subset. This is not Frozen full conformance and does not publish the local 0.2 header.",
