      "notes": "Pins the private PNG header, Rust dependency closure, and exact two-consumer graph (the resolver direct path edge plus the C ABI optional png-v1 edge), proves the runtime-c-abi package inventory, verifies exact default/ABI 0.2 export isolation, and runs C11/C++17 hosts against feature-isolated PNG dynamic and static libraries on all three native CI operating systems.",
