        ".github/workflows/runtime-native.yml"
      ],
      "notes": "Pins the private Asset Model v1 resolver foundation, approved schema and live AJV 2020-12 parity with its static Rust equivalent, dependency license/checksum closure, Rust 1.89 metadata, exact C ABI non-expansion, and default native tests/Clippy. The sibling workflow also compiles tests and runs Clippy for wasm32-unknown-unknown from an isolated clean target.",
